  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roundtable youth agripreneurship Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accordance with the embassy goals on enhancing opportunities for young people, among others in their top-sectors, the embassy is organizing a roundtable on youth in agriculture, around the questions how to create and run a business in agri-tech and what is needed in the ecosystem to make them scalable. During this roundtable, the interaction between young and more established agripreneurs is key to explore the challenges facing young agripreneurs and come up with solutions. At the end of the session, the youth will discuss the outcomes of the discussion with important stakeholders like investors and policy makers. The day will be finished by a cocktail event with important stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
